    "en": "I draw a circle with my fingertip and accept. A young man in a black suit appears—Logos. The brighter the light around his outline, the darker the shadow, like a drawing that can’t decide its lines.",
    "ja": "Ghost Hackerの仕事は、そういう固まったmemeを解放して、流れに戻すことだ。"
